{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HELLBOUND INC</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HELLBOUND INC</strong> is a rage-inducing platformer where you play as an undead courier trapped in a fulfillment center recently purchased by Satan himself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're the newest hire in Hell\u2019s most infernal logistics startup. Your job? Deliver cursed packages across treacherous warehouse zones, dodge deadly traps, solve infernal puzzles, and make sure everything arrives on time. In Hell, missing a delivery deadline is eternal damnation. Again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746940/extras/41126330cd5c20a2aec9813e44b16c7f.poster.avif?t=1757353561\" width=616 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746940/extras/41126330cd5c20a2aec9813e44b16c7f.webm?t=1757353561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746940/extras/41126330cd5c20a2aec9813e44b16c7f.mp4?t=1757353561\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >YOU\u2019RE UNDEAD, BUT NOT UNEMPLOYED</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate rooms filled with spikes, flame jets, demonic machinery, and collapsing platforms. Push crates, flip switches, activate conveyor belts, and time your jumps to get each delivery to its destination. Every area is a tightly designed challenge that tests both your reflexes and your problem-solving skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746940/extras/5ec5c2e42813b4322b4361f2d5358a78.poster.avif?t=1757353561\" width=616 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746940/extras/5ec5c2e42813b4322b4361f2d5358a78.webm?t=1757353561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746940/extras/5ec5c2e42813b4322b4361f2d5358a78.mp4?t=1757353561\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >YOU WILL DIE. A LOT.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But that\u2019s okay \u2014 you\u2019re already un-dead. Instant respawns keep the pace fast as you retry and learn each delivery route. Every room has a solution... but it may not be the one you expect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746940/extras/379ad903484ef71a2d6a9507361984e7.poster.avif?t=1757353561\" width=616 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746940/extras/379ad903484ef71a2d6a9507361984e7.webm?t=1757353561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746940/extras/379ad903484ef71a2d6a9507361984e7.mp4?t=1757353561\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THIS IS YOUR AFTERLIFE NOW</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you dive deeper into the warehouse, you\u2019ll encounter even more elaborate delivery puzzles, new environmental hazards, and increasingly absurd demonic logistics systems.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >IN HELLBOUND INC YOU\u2019LL FIND:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immortal gameplay: precision 2D platforming with puzzle mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hellish soundtrack to keep you marching through the flames</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 100 handcrafted puzzle rooms to master</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple Challenges (Time trials and Limited Deaths)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 Hell Circles to explore!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Final delivery gauntlets that push everything you\u2019ve learned</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bonus rooms with optional challenges and hidden collectibles</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DELIVER OR BURN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s no rest for the dead. Clock in, grab your Package, and make the delivery \u2014 because Satan doesn\u2019t do refunds.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3746940?t=1757353561","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746940/4e7a3b47cf09cf7fb3101745bb73b9a9306c97b2/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757353561","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746940/50bdf796486c2e6da378bc3b482b187cfc41ed80/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757353561","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746940/50bdf796486c2e6da378bc3b482b187cfc41ed80/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757353561","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HELLBOUND INC</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HELLBOUND INC</strong> is a rage-inducing platformer where you play as an undead courier trapped in a fulfillment center recently purchased by Satan himself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're the newest hire in Hell\u2019s most infernal logistics startup. Your job? Deliver cursed packages across treacherous warehouse zones, dodge deadly traps, solve infernal puzzles, and make sure everything arrives on time. In Hell, missing a delivery deadline is eternal damnation. Again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746940/extras/41126330cd5c20a2aec9813e44b16c7f.poster.avif?t=1757353561\" width=616 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746940/extras/41126330cd5c20a2aec9813e44b16c7f.webm?t=1757353561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746940/extras/41126330cd5c20a2aec9813e44b16c7f.mp4?t=1757353561\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >YOU\u2019RE UNDEAD, BUT NOT UNEMPLOYED</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate rooms filled with spikes, flame jets, demonic machinery, and collapsing platforms. Push crates, flip switches, activate conveyor belts, and time your jumps to get each delivery to its destination. Every area is a tightly designed challenge that tests both your reflexes and your problem-solving skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746940/extras/5ec5c2e42813b4322b4361f2d5358a78.poster.avif?t=1757353561\" width=616 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746940/extras/5ec5c2e42813b4322b4361f2d5358a78.webm?t=1757353561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746940/extras/5ec5c2e42813b4322b4361f2d5358a78.mp4?t=1757353561\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >YOU WILL DIE. A LOT.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But that\u2019s okay \u2014 you\u2019re already un-dead. Instant respawns keep the pace fast as you retry and learn each delivery route. Every room has a solution... but it may not be the one you expect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746940/extras/379ad903484ef71a2d6a9507361984e7.poster.avif?t=1757353561\" width=616 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746940/extras/379ad903484ef71a2d6a9507361984e7.webm?t=1757353561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746940/extras/379ad903484ef71a2d6a9507361984e7.mp4?t=1757353561\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THIS IS YOUR AFTERLIFE NOW</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you dive deeper into the warehouse, you\u2019ll encounter even more elaborate delivery puzzles, new environmental hazards, and increasingly absurd demonic logistics systems.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >IN HELLBOUND INC YOU\u2019LL FIND:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immortal gameplay: precision 2D platforming with puzzle mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hellish soundtrack to keep you marching through the flames</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 100 handcrafted puzzle rooms to master</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple Challenges (Time trials and Limited Deaths)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 Hell Circles to explore!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Final delivery gauntlets that push everything you\u2019ve learned</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bonus rooms with optional challenges and hidden collectibles</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DELIVER OR BURN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s no rest for the dead. Clock in, grab your Package, and make the delivery \u2014 because Satan doesn\u2019t do refunds.</p>","developers":["Templo","Rewilder"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746940/64501de5ed160c6714a29da38525ed7ddcb3666d/header.jpg?t=1757353561","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_u